Hello,

I’m having a problem with the Instants app on my iPhone.

The app opens for about 5 seconds and then closes. Before closing, it shows the message:

“Please check back soon. Instants is not available at this time.”

My Instagram account has no restrictions. I checked Account Status and everything is OK.

I have already tried:

* disabling VPN;
* Wi-Fi and mobile data;
* checking my iPhone and App Store region (United States);
* setting Date & Time to automatic;
* updating Instants;
* reinstalling/offloading Instants.

Instagram itself works normally in Safari.

Could you please check whether Instants is enabled and available for my Instagram account?
